msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.mimebind.metainfo.xml:13
msgid ""
"Applications are credited with the subtypes the MIME database derives from "
"the types they declare"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.mimebind.metainfo.xml:14
msgid ""
